s, lights, or microphones.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\">\n  <h3>What is an overhead phone mount used for?</h3>\n  <p>It is used for cooking, crafts, unboxing, drawing, repairs, product demos, and any shot where the viewer needs to see the work surface.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\">\n  <h3>Do I need a clamp or weighted base?</h3>\n  <p>Use a clamp when the mount needs to attach to a desk edge or shelf. Use a weighted base when you want a movable station without clamping.</p>\n</div>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"ItemList\",\n  \"name\": \"Live Streaming Phone and Camera Mounts\",\n  \"url\": \"https://iboltmounts.com/collections/live-streaming\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n      \"position\": 1,\n      \"item\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Product\",\n        \"name\": \"iBOLT Stream-Cast Creator Custom Mount Kit\",\n        \"url\": \"https://iboltmounts.com/products/ibolt-stream-cast-creator-custom-mount-kit-with-over-60-variations-live-streaming-tutorial-videos-ibsc-34615\",\n        \"image\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0818/5957/6100/products/ibolt-mounts-ibolt-stream-cast-creator-custom-mount-kit-with-over-60-variations-great-for-live-streaming-tutorial-videos-and-photos-1050407750.jpg?v=1768845551\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n      \"position\": 2,\n      \"item\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Product\",\n        \"name\": \"iBOLT Stream-Cast sPro2 Phone Stand\",\n        \"url\": \"https://iboltmounts.com/products/ibolt-stream-cast-spro2-phone-stand-weighted-base-mount-for-live-streaming-distance-learning-ibsc-34611\",\n        \"image\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0818/5957/6100/products/ibolt-mounts-ibolt-stream-cast-spro2-phone-stand-weighted-base-mount-1050407865.jpg?v=1768847170\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n      \"position\": 3,\n      \"item\": {\n        \"@type